# File capabilities for breathgslb (saphira-permissions V1).
#
# Privileged port 53 as an unprivileged service: the file
# capability carries that single privilege (systemd additionally
# grants it ambiently via the unit). Declared here instead of a
# build-time setcap so the authority survives in the package as a
# caps.d fragment (APK records no capability state): install,
# upgrade, and ensure-permissions --system all converge from this
# declaration via ensure-caps. r3 migration (setcap line removed
# from recipe_install the same revision).
cap /usr/sbin/breathgslb cap_net_bind_service+ep
